Short:        Library for MAXs BBS doors.
Author:       cdemaeyer@mmm.com (Chris De Maeyer)
Uploader:     cdemaeyer mmm com
Type:         dev/c
Version:      1.0
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This archive contains a linkable library containing functions to create
doors for MAX's BBS.

Features:       - general door creation
                - general door operations
                - user data structures functions
                - ANSI support funtions.

